sequenceDiagram
    participant CM as ConnectivityManager
    participant Obs as ConnectivityObserver (Flow)
    participant RT as RealtimeConnection (Ch 63)
    participant Retry as Retry (Ch 2)
    participant UI as UI (Ch 6)

    CM->>Obs: onLost -> NetworkState.Offline
    Obs->>UI: show offline banner
    Obs->>RT: pause/stop reconnect attempts (don't thrash)
    CM->>Obs: onAvailable + onCapabilitiesChanged(validated)
    Obs->>UI: hide banner (Online, validated)
    Obs->>RT: reconnect WebSocket (Ch 63)
    Obs->>Retry: retry failed requests (Ch 2)
